WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.296
Today we will reuse materials while arranging an image. Our work connects with

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:06.472
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:10.846
Sort clean paper by colour and select pieces for your picture.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.580
Arrange pieces on cardboard before applying glue.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:20.780
Stick the pieces down and explain the main image. Explain one respectful similarity

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.124
or difference with another African example.
